  "native_source_pin": "794d90f2c2dbb90f0c56ba8cc527fa1494aa8ef6",
  "limitations": [
    "Use each complete native material or forming service per signed source kg with factor +1; preserve caller uncertainty, formulas, foreground ownership, separately listed polymer, transport and direct emissions.",
    "Where the source is a delivered market, its supplier shares, delivery freight and losses are not reconstructed from the at-plant proxy. Native internal freight and complete upstream inventories remain included once. Source global/RoW supply is approximated by the declared native European supply; source and target geography, technology mix, vintage, allocation, emission coverage and data quality differ. Equal inventories or LCIA scores are not established.",
    "All inspected native 2025 and 2026 suppliers have positive one-kg references and unchanged direct technosphere identities and quantities across these releases. Native 2025 forming-service comments state the matching yield but omit the full bulk-polymer exclusion text present in 2026; unchanged direct technosphere vectors support the same service boundary. Native biosphere differences and the imported upstream exclusions remain in force. Only the exact enumerated source profiles are registered; other profiles, reverse routes and cross-system-model conversions are not inferred."
  ],
